# Netscape HTTP Cookie File
# This file is used if you need authenticated access to SoundCloud streams.
# The bot fetches stream URLs via the SoundCloud API v2 using client IDs,
# so cookies are typically not required.
#
# If you encounter 403 errors on stream downloads even with valid client IDs,
# you can export your SoundCloud session cookies here.
#
# Format:
# .soundcloud.com	TRUE	/	FALSE	0	value_name	value
#
# To get your cookies:
# 1. Log in to soundcloud.com in your browser
# 2. Install the "Get cookies.txt" extension (Chrome/Firefox)
# 3. Export cookies for soundcloud.com
# 4. Save as cookies.txt in the project root
#
# Note: This file is NOT used by the current SoundCloud API v2 integration.
# It is kept for future use if direct stream authentication is needed.
